# iSmile Dental Clinic Website - Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Build a premium, "liquid glass" themed website for iSmile Dental Clinic. The site will be built using React and Vite, focusing on a high-end, modern aesthetic with smooth animations and glassmorphism effects.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Color Palette**: I need the specific Hex codes from the attached image to ensure the colors are exact. For now, I will use placeholders (e.g., `--color-primary: #00bcd4`).
> **Images**: I will use the attached logo and placeholders for other images until provided.

